      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STYLIN' (3) disappointed at the end of last campaign when an odds-on pop, with the rider suggesting she may have had enough. She's been freshened since and lines up here with 77 days between runs.  Drawn the inside now and Fiore reunites. Can return with a bang. ART SESSION (1) will find this a more suitable assignment after being caught late at Northam in a CL5. That effort rates highly here and Faithull remaining in the saddle is a good push for his chances. Appears the main danger. LAVISH CHARM (2) showed good early muster and fought on to finish third last start over 1100m at this track. Looks well placed so expect another big run. DANCEWITHME (4) progressed nicely last start to finish a close second over 1200m at this track after missing the placings at the previous appearance. Suitably placed so anticipating another big run. SUNLIT FRESCO (8) is next best.",
